{#
Response to creating, editing or removing a user: refresh the list and close.

The whole frame is replaced rather than one row, for the same reason the
integrations list is: adding or removing an administrator changes what the
*other* rows may do — the delete button disappears from the last admin — and
the list is small enough that redrawing it costs nothing.
#}
<turbo-stream action="replace" target="admin-users">
    <template>
        {% include 'admin/user/_users_frame.html.twig' %}
    </template>
</turbo-stream>
